      "target": "arith-zero-to-b",
      "structural_tag": "one PA zero instance plus one equality transport",
      "latex": "a=b,\\ b=c,\\ c=d\\ \\vdash_{\\mathcal T_{\\mathrm{PA}}}\\ a+0=b",
      "english": "Assuming a equals b, b equals c, and c equals d, adding zero to a gives b."
    },
