      "latex": "a=b,\\ b=c,\\ c=d\\ \\vdash_{\\mathcal T_{\\mathrm{PA}}}\\ a+S(0)=S(b)",
      "english": "Under the same three equalities, adding one to a gives the successor of b."
    },
