      "target": "inc-Cv",
      "structural_tag": "four quantified I.2 instantiations then incidence transport",
      "latex": "H(A,B,u,v),\\ \\operatorname{Incident}(C,u),\\ v=w\\ \\vdash_{\\mathcal T_{\\mathrm{I.2}}}\\ \\operatorname{Incident}(C,v)",
      "english": "The guard says that the distinct points A and B are incident with both lines u and v. If C is incident with u, C is incident with v; the equality v equals w remains a declared premise. No Point(C) premise is added."
    },
